				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dicitur <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p18465">regina Angliae</persName> misso fetiali indixisse bellum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/><persName ref="p20977">Guysianis</persName> pro <persName ref="p8315">Condensi</persName> et quod maximus equitatus <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>et peditatus proficiscatur ex <placeName ref="l2477">Palatinatu</placeName>, <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l213">Hes<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>sia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1750">Lunebur<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>go</placeName> etc. in auxilium <persName ref="p8315">Condensis</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Confirmantur illa vera esse, quae <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>scripsi de victoria domini ab <persName ref="p20637">Aderes</persName> et quod <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>caesi sint aliquot <placeName ref="l473">Sangallenses</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Expectamus in <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>horas alia nova, scimus et audimus caedes <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>inaestimabiles fieri in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Iam fama s<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>pargit redire <persName ref="p21320">abbatem Heremi</persName> ex con<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>cilio, dissolut m esse concilium, saltem ob fam<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>em et caritatem; nobis iterum negari <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>forum ex <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName>, turbas <placeName ref="l55">Bononiae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>excitari et nescio quid aliud.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Das wil ich <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>glouben, wenn ichs grüntlicher von üch be<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>richt wirt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Accepi 5. sessionem i<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>mpressam et materiam 6. sessionis 17. septembris <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>celebrandam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Si ergo potes, acquire mihi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>2., 3., 4. sessionem; nihil gratius mihi obvenire posset.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Festinavi, male pinxi; boni consule.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum tuis et nostris omnibus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">21. <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>augusti 1562.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Non relegi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tuus, qui semper.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Darunter v. <persName ref="p8009">Fabricius</persName> die Notiz:]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Verum esse affirmatur per idem temp<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>us, quod d. <persName>de Susa</persName>, qui <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>8000 millibus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l2735">Provin<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ciam</placeName> ingressus, fusus fugatusqu<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>e sit a d. de <persName ref="p20637">Adreß</persName>, cuius <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>copiae 4000 mille non multu<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>m excessere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fideli ministro, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>et fratri colendo et dilecto.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>